**Why this?** Browsers block mixed HTTP/HTTPS fetches (CORS/mixed-content errors). Proxy runs on your server (HTTPS via Vercel deploy), fetches for frontend safely. Keeps it simple: One `/iss` endpoint mirroring Open Notify.

